---
import { CALENDLY_URL } from '../../lib/site'
import { Image } from 'astro:assets'
import headshot from '../../assets/headshot.webp'
import CTA from '../text/CTA'

---

<section id="founder" class="founder">
  <div class="section-split items-center">
    <figure class="founder-photo">
      <Image
        src={headshot}
        alt="Josh Nussbaum, founder of Wave Land"
        width={640}
        height={640}
        layout="constrained"
        class="rounded-2xl"
      />
    </figure>

    <div class="flex flex-col gap-6">
      <h2>Hi, I’m Josh.</h2>
      <p class="text-lightGrey">
        Before web development, I spent 10+ years as a session guitarist. The stage looks different
        these days, but the job is the same: learn the material deeply, serve the project, and make
        everyone around me sound good.
      </p>
      <p class="text-lightGrey">
        My first development job was in-house, building for brands like L’Oréal and AAA. It taught
        me that I do my best work as a partner, not just a pair of hands. Agencies working at that
        level need exactly that.
      </p>
      <p class="text-lightGrey">
        When you work with Wave Land, you work with me, from the first call to launch day and
        after.
      </p>

      <CTA
        tag="link"
        href={CALENDLY_URL}
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        text="Book a 15-Minute Call"
        size="large"
      />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .founder-photo {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0.75rem;
    border: 1px dashed var(--color-darkGrey);
    border-radius: 1.25rem;
    max-width: 32rem;
  }
</style>
